79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I vote for Plan A. It is the only candidate that minimizes administrative friction and physical risk, ensuring the project actually reaches completion.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
