81,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I vote for Plan A. It's the only option that uses the ring-fenced funds and avoids the operating budget, so we can finally stop arguing about the money.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
